 problems that's facing  and there are many problems indeed each  the island is dealing with so people  that I talk to here on the streets told  me that they think it is their a  Victorian that there are satisfied that  he is stepping down he himself said that  he has to stay in office until August  second to make sure that there will be a  good transition his Secretary of Justice  is going to take over however we have to  say as you mentioned that Puerto Rico  has a lot of problems they had a serious  of corruption scandals they are still  recovering from eureka eureka maria they  went through a long recession and they  had to declare bankruptcy and are still  waiting for a new political class people  here in san juan told me alexander  thanks for bringing us up-to-date live  from San Juan Puerto Rico thank you very  much
 

